\inf_A \sup_\theta R_T^\theta(A)=\sup_\pi \Psi_T(\pi)
\]
is asserted rather than proved. The finite-grid version is also mismatched with continuum \(\sup_{a\in[0,1]}\) quantities, and the continuum passage requires nontrivial measurability, compactness, and discretization-error control.

